Final Research Report
=====================

This directory contains the final scientific report for the undergraduate
research project:

Study of Code Duplication in Linux Kernel Subsystems: Analysis, Refactoring,
and Contributions

Project Information
-------------------

* Funding agency: São Paulo Research Foundation (FAPESP)
* Research period: November 1, 2025 - October 31, 2026
* Scientific report deadline: October 30, 2026
